{"id":"64d83554d467a24a","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-tree.md","title":"树与无限路径","display":"df-tree — 树与无限路径","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-tree","aliases":["43-df-tree"],"display":"df-tree — 树与无限路径","depends_on":["[[43-df-prefix]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§5.16.1, print p.62 / PDF p.82","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"definition-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tree — 树与无限路径"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"801a9dba9cbba1c7\" href=\"?note=801a9dba9cbba1c7\" title=\"43-df-prefix\">43-df-prefix</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§5.16.1, print p.62 / PDF p.82"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(T\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Tree}(T)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\sigma\\in T\\;\\forall\\tau\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(\\tau\\sqsubseteq\\sigma\\Rightarrow\\tau\\in T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Tree}(T)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\sigma\\in T\\;\\forall\\tau\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(\\tau\\sqsubseteq\\sigma\\Rightarrow\\tau\\in T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Paths}(T):=\\{X\\in2^\\omega:\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ (X\\upharpoonright n\\in T)\\},\\qquad[T]:=\\operatorname{Paths}(T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Paths}(T):=\\{X\\in2^\\omega:\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ (X\\upharpoonright n\\in T)\\},\\qquad[T]:=\\operatorname{Paths}(T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T_\\sigma:=\\{\\tau\\in T:\\tau\\sqsubseteq\\sigma\\lor\\sigma\\sqsubseteq\\tau\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{Ext}_T:=\\{\\sigma\\in T:\\exists X\\in[T]\\ (\\sigma\\sqsubseteq X)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T_\\sigma:=\\{\\tau\\in T:\\tau\\sqsubseteq\\sigma\\lor\\sigma\\sqsubseteq\\tau\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{Ext}_T:=\\{\\sigma\\in T:\\exists X\\in[T]\\ (\\sigma\\sqsubseteq X)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>柱集并统一记为 OpenHull(S)，见柱集原子；[T]保留给本原子的树路径集，避免同一串集合被赋予两个不同的集合值。</p>\n<p>来源：§5.16.1, print p.62 / PDF p.82。版本为用户提供的 2007-07-28 草稿。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-prefix","status":"resolved","id":"801a9dba9cbba1c7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-prefix]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Tree}(T)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\sigma\\in T\\;\\forall\\tau\\in2^{<\\omega}\\;(\\tau\\sqsubseteq\\sigma\\Rightarrow\\tau\\in T).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Paths}(T):=\\{X\\in2^\\omega:\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ (X\\upharpoonright n\\in T)\\},\\qquad[T]:=\\operatorname{Paths}(T).","display":true},{"tex":"T_\\sigma:=\\{\\tau\\in T:\\tau\\sqsubseteq\\sigma\\lor\\sigma\\sqsubseteq\\tau\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{Ext}_T:=\\{\\sigma\\in T:\\exists X\\in[T]\\ (\\sigma\\sqsubseteq X)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1215,"backlinks":[{"id":"cc07cf2b9ec0019e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal C\\subseteq2^\\omega$；$A\\in\\mathcal O$，$\\operatorname{Tree},[T]$ 见 [[43-df-tree]]，$\\chi_T$ 经串编码解释。 $\\mathcal O$、$\\operatorname{AsSet}$、$\\operatorname{AsSequence}$ 采用 [[43-df-infseq]]；集合性质作用于序列时依以下关系或已有共同oracle接口解释。"},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-37","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-tree]] — 树与无限路径"},{"id":"b73c178d9ab1abe7","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：[[43-df-tree]]。"}],"outgoing":["801a9dba9cbba1c7"]}